flowchart TD
    A[Invoice Upload / Email] --> B[OCR or Parse File]
    B --> C[Extract Fields]
    C --> D[Validate Business Rules]
    D --> E{Valid?}
    E -- No --> F[Route to Exception Queue]
    E -- Yes --> G[Check Duplicates]
    G --> H{Duplicate?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Flag + Stop]
    H -- No --> J[Approval Workflow]
    J --> K{Approved?}
    K -- No --> L[Reject + Log]
    K -- Yes --> M[Sync to Accounting System]
    M --> N[Write Audit Log]
